{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WizardsBane is a 2D, Top-Down, Action-RPG with a Bullet Hell twist, where you have to grind for Achievements to get Stronger.  <br> <br>Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 300+ Achievements in the Game. Getting these Achievements will reward you with Achievement Score which can be used to acquire skills in the Skill Tree.<br> <br>Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each Stage you will encounter Bosses. Killing the Bosses is the main objective to progress further and get Items. Each boss has unique Items, which are more powerful than regular items but drop rarely.<br> <br>Difficulties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have become powerful enough, you can try to succeed in higher difficulties to get higher rarity Items and more Achievement Score.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111010?t=1761838385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111010?t=1761838385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111010/a4c653538bed6bac7344619ec1f33c8d141a846f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761838385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111010/a4c653538bed6bac7344619ec1f33c8d141a846f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761838385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence without blood."},"demos":[{"appid":4111060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WizardsBane is a 2D, Top-Down, Action-RPG with a Bullet Hell twist, where you have to grind for Achievements to get Stronger.  <br> <br>Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 300+ Achievements in the Game. Getting these Achievements will reward you with Achievement Score which can be used to acquire skills in the Skill Tree.<br> <br>Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each Stage you will encounter Bosses. Killing the Bosses is the main objective to progress further and get Items. Each boss has unique Items, which are more powerful than regular items but drop rarely.<br> <br>Difficulties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have become powerful enough, you can try to succeed in higher difficulties to get higher rarity Items and more Achievement Score.</p>","developers":["gugu games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111010/57838e587596fc1f784cd56802da6b76ab86f7a4/header.jpg?t=1761838385","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111010/1480081482/aa1f07458dd0cddadffab0e75a808be73721d0b2/1761753984/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761838383","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111010/1480081482/aa1f07458dd0cddadffab0e75a808be73721d0b2/1761753984/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761838383","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4111010/1480081482/aa1f07458dd0cddadffab0e75a808be73721d0b2/1761753984/hls_264